'''Black Slug''' (なめ（黒）''Name (Kuro)'') is a [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemy that first appears in [[Sliming to Victory]]. It was added in [[Version 6.1 Update|Version 6.1]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Black Slug
|appearance = [[Sliming to Victory]]<br>
[[Citadel#Black|Dark Citadel]]
|image = E 342.png
|money drop = 500¢ - 1,975¢
}}

==Enemy==
This is the fastest Slug variant and the second-strongest stat-wise. In earlier stages, it can be easily dealt with by any cat, but in later stages it gets tougher, acting as an annoying support for stronger enemies.

