==Trivia==
*In the [[Media:Eve l 051 en.png|event poster]] for [[Sliming to Victory]], [[Red Slug]], Black Slug and [[Angelic Slug]] are all referred to as Sluggy, which was the only name they had until they were added to the [[Enemy Guide]] in [[Version 13.3 Update|Version 13.3]].
*Unlike the [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] trait, [[Gory Dark]], [[Dark Cyclone]] and [[Dark Wind]], Black Slug did not have the "Black" in its name changed to "Dark" in [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]] [[Version 15.3 Update|15.3]].

